ection_cursor`로 마지막 반영 seq 추적).\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-15-3. **단일 writer**: 데몬 내부에서도 쓰기는 하나의 큐(직렬)로 모은다. 읽기는 별 연결 허용.\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md:16:4. **비밀 금지**: 토큰·API 키·자격증명은 저장하지 않는다. OS 키링 참조 ID만 저장. 저널 payload는 저장 전 마스킹 필터 통과.\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-17-5. **대화 원문 미저장**: 에이전트 메시지 본문은 세션 참조(네이티브 ID)로 공식 API에서 읽는다. 저널은 요약·해시·아이템 ID만(선택: 디버그용 원문 저장 옵션, 기본 off).\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-18-\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-19-## 2. 테이블\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-20-\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-21-### 2.1 저널\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-22-\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-23-```sql\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-24-CREATE TABLE events (\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-25-  seq            INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,          -- 단조 증가(AUTOINCREMENT 불필요: 삭제 없음)\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-26-  event_id       TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,         -- ULID\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-27-  ts             TEXT NOT NULL,                -- ISO-8601 UTC\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-28-  type           TEXT NOT NULL,                -- TaskTransition, ApprovalRequested, ...\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-29-  workspace_id   TEXT, project_id TEXT, phase_id TEXT, task_id TEXT,\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-30-  agent_run_id   TEXT, session_ref TEXT,\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-31-  correlation_id TEXT,                         -- 요청/승인 묶음\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-32-  causation_seq  INTEGER,                      -- 원인 이벤트\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md-33-  fencing_token  INTEGER,                      -- 쓰기 당시 lease 토큰(검증용)\ndocs/planning/02_agents_state/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md:34:  payload        TE